{% set crop_rows = farm_polygon.dimensions[0].row %}
{% set aisles = crop_rows - 1 %}
{% if farm_polygon.row_orientation | default("east_west") == "north_south" %}
{% set row_direction = "north to south" %}
{% set numbering = "west to east" %}
{% set ends = "north and south" %}
{% else %}
{% set row_direction = "west to east" %}
{% set numbering = "north to south" %}
{% set ends = "west and east" %}
{% endif %}
FARM LAYOUT:

Field boundary (GPS):
{% for point in farm_polygon.points %}
{{ point.lat }}, {{ point.lon }}
{% endfor %}

Crop rows: {{ crop_rows }}, running {{ row_direction }}, numbered 1 to {{ crop_rows }} from {{ numbering }}.
Aisles: {{ aisles }}, numbered 1 to {{ aisles }} from {{ numbering }}.
Aisle k lies between crop row k and crop row k+1. Each aisle has a head at its {{ ends }} ends.
Missions refer to whole crop rows, not individual plants.

RULES:
- You CANNOT drive across crop rows. Travel only along aisles.
- Use MoveToAisleHead to move. Do NOT use GPS or relative movements.
- Enter an aisle with MoveToAisleHead, then exit it with MoveToAisleHead using the same aisle id. Exiting drives the robot down the whole aisle to the opposite head.
- To change aisles, exit the current aisle first, then enter the next one.
- Do NOT add a final return movement. End the mission when the last task is done.

SEEDER RULES:
- Crop row k can be planted from aisle k-1 or aisle k (row 1 only from aisle 1, row {{ crop_rows }} only from aisle {{ aisles }}).
- To plant a row: enter aisle -> select seed -> activate seeder -> plant seed -> deactivate seeder -> exit aisle.
- If the next row uses the same seed, do NOT select the seed again.

USE THIS INFORMATION TO CREATE THE XML MISSION.
